\\ --------- Transformation Macros -------- \\

\\ Register reference Table
\\ @a - centre cell of current region
\\ @b - number of live cells excluding centre in current region
\\ @c - mapped cells for current region
\\ @i - row processing index
\\ @j - column processing index
\\ @m - max number of rows
\\ @n - max numbers of columns
\\ @p - padding generator
\\ @g (@0) - increment register (@0) by 1
\\ @h (@0) - decrement register (@0) by 1
\\ @s - one generation
\\ @l - remove unnecessary padding layer if all cells are dead
\\ @t - trim padding/outermost layer

\\ Macro @p - Adds a layer of padding
\\ 'i, @m, @n must be set correctly
\\ 2@p fails because @m and @n aren't updated
